tion of our hyperbola in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}^{2}-49{y}^{2} & =98 \\\\ \\frac{2{x}^{2}}{98}-\\frac{49{y}^{2}}{98} & =1 \\\\ \\frac{{x}^{2}}{49}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{2} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we $a=\\sqrt{49}=7$ and $b=\\sqrt{2}.$ Therefore, the parametric equations are\n\n$$\nx=7\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-7990/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2669e657-da47-5e22-9ac5-7a69f3b0a55f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-7990"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-274724/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "df4c4eb8-96a0-545d-a6f8-499124fc191e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274724/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "d6875cb5-cc3c-5f78-88bf-d097db699f0e" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274724/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-274724/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-274724/field-2/7a019166d53f8f445cfca04bbbb5d9fea414f91656d4091feae12bd71715d58a" :answer/id #uuid "ec90d138-f991-5591-a271-d92e9a9b83bb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\tan(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-274724/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "9f077401-361a-57c7-a4a2-8417e7e4c1f0" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-274724/field-2/7a019166d53f8f445cfca04bbbb5d9fea414f91656d4091feae12bd71715d58a" :answer-field/choices ["q-274724/field-2/7a019166d53f8f445cfca04bbbb5d9fea414f91656d4091feae12bd71715d58a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-274724" :question/id #uuid "a09d68de-1a08-55b5-aa08-f2bd33065296" :question/math-academy-id "q-274724" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14053984/assets/060fcf34b388e42aa557ac8182c724236cf8ec161e37fa4fe1e96a0b63fab44f.png)\n\nComplete the following parametric equations generating the hyperbola above in terms of the parameter $t,$ defined for $t\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ]$ where $t\\ne \\pm \\frac{\\pi }{2},$ given that its asymptotes are $y=\\pm \\frac{5}{2}x.$\n\n$x=$\n{{field-1}}\n$\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=$\n{{field-2}}" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of a horizontal hyperbola centered at the origin with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\n$$\n\nwhere $a$ and $b$ are positive constants.\n\nThe vertices of the hyperbola occur at $(\\pm a,0).$ From the graph, we have that $(2,0)$ is a vertex of the hyperbola, so $a=2.$\n\nThe asymptotes of a horizontal hyperbola are $y=\\pm \\frac{b}{a}x.$ In our case, the asymptotes are $y=\\pm \\frac{5}{2}x,$ and so we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{b}{a} & =\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ \\frac{b}{2} & =\\frac{5}{2} \\\\ b & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the hyperbola are\n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=5\\operatorname{tan}⁡t.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-274724/field-1" "q-274724/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "32fc8440-e872-50e4-ab98-5861d1c7310e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-274724"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-325916/field-1/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "d7ba4f1f-8f87-57e1-92fc-b596f0931296" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-325916/field-1/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271